# inc-yp23: a hiding rogue steps east into a watcher's view, then strikes it.
# The scene (INCURSION_HIDE_STRIKE_PROBE) places the watcher one square north-east
# of the square east of the rogue. INCURSION_HIDE_STRIKE_PROBE=freeze: the
# watcher cannot act between the step and the blow. =act: it acts in between
# (5 ticks into the step).
ENTER
RIGHT
@dump:hide-strike-stepped
PGUP
@while "Confirm attack" y
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hide-strike-struck
@quit
